{"v":1,"built_at":"2026-09-17T19:18:53.688Z","core":{"appSha":"9080551f79e9","builtAt":"2026-09-16T23:55:57.894Z","schemaV":1},"key":"us/119-s-4668","model":{"found":true,"billKey":"us/119-s-4668","polity":"us","eyebrow":"United States","reference":"S. 4668","title":"Protect College Sports Act of 2026","titleExpandable":false,"meta":"Commerce, Science, and Transportation Committee · Sen. Ted Cruz (R-TX)","summary":{"lead":"Summary: ","text":"The bill would protect college athletes' rights to earn money from their names, images, and likenesses by prohibiting schools from restricting these deals, while requiring athletes to disclose compensation above $600 and capping agent fees at 5%. It would also grant athletes one penalty-free transfer, restrict coaches from switching teams mid-season, establish limits on how schools can compensate athletes to avoid circumventing revenue-sharing rules, and allow schools and conferences to jointly sell sports broadcasting rights under limited antitrust protections.","aiTag":"[AI-Generated]"},"pathLabel":"The legislative path","latest":{"labelText":"Motion to proceed filed","glyph":{"icon":"ballot","stroke":1.95},"date":"16 September 2026"},"asOf":{"lead":"Record as of ","date":"16 September 2026","note":"the most recent action in the official record. Status can lag; each step below carries its own date."},"groups":[{"spine":{"key":"us-s4668-20260917181239-0be2687a","kind":"post","spine":true,"date":"16 September 2026","labelText":"Motion to proceed filed","glyph":{"icon":"ballot","stroke":1.95},"postId":"us-20260917-39bf87a9","postHref":"/p/us-20260917-39bf87a9","whatsNext":{"lead":"What's next: ","text":"The Senate votes on taking it up (the motion can be withdrawn)"}},"isTip":true,"hidden":[],"moreLabel":"0 more actions","hideLabel":"Hide","a11yShow":"Show 0 more recorded actions","a11yHide":"Hide 0 more recorded actions"},{"spine":{"key":"us-s4668-20260916195838-d6a5eebc","kind":"post","spine":true,"date":"15 September 2026","la